WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.604 --> 00:00:16.190
The rest of the day, Vinnie and Mandy were busy.

2
00:00:17.270 --> 00:00:19.191
They had many chores to do!

3
00:00:21.712 --> 00:00:26.094
So the next morning, the children headed straight for the attic.

4
00:00:26.114 --> 00:00:28.795
"Where's the photo?"

5
00:00:29.335 --> 00:00:30.135
Mandy asked.

6
00:00:30.155 --> 00:00:34.497
"Here." Vinnie pulled it out of his pocket.

7
00:00:34.517 --> 00:00:37.839
"Mandy!" he cried.

8
00:00:37.859 --> 00:00:40.841
"The sail and shields stopped glowing!"

9
00:00:42.522 --> 00:00:44.863
The old man was gone from the photo.

10
00:00:46.524 --> 00:00:50.686
Instead, Vinnie and Mandy were standing by the Viking ship.

11
00:00:51.467 --> 00:00:54.008
Vinnie put the picture back in the album.

12
00:00:55.129 --> 00:00:56.609
Then he turned the page.

13
00:00:56.629 --> 00:01:00.932
"Mandy, look at this!"

14
00:01:01.764 --> 00:01:02.805
Vinnie exclaimed.

15
00:01:02.825 --> 00:01:05.567
"Here's a new glowing picture!"

16
00:01:06.888 --> 00:01:08.609
Mandy stared at the photo.

17
00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:14.733
The old man stood next to a statue of a woman with a tall helmet.

18
00:01:18.476 --> 00:01:19.977
The helmet was glowing.

19
00:01:21.598 --> 00:01:26.121
The tall statue had a small winged figure in one hand.

20
00:01:27.482 --> 00:01:29.264
The other hand held a shield.

21
00:01:30.608 --> 00:01:31.548
"Where is this?"

22
00:01:32.389 --> 00:01:33.089
asked Vinnie.

23
00:01:33.109 --> 00:01:36.550
"I don't know," said Mandy.

24
00:01:37.470 --> 00:01:40.071
She took the photo to look more closely.

25
00:01:41.011 --> 00:01:44.352
Suddenly, they heard footsteps climbing the stairs.

26
00:01:44.372 --> 00:01:47.493
"What are you doing up there, kids?"

27
00:01:48.133 --> 00:01:48.833
It was Dad.

28
00:01:48.853 --> 00:01:50.734
"What should we do?"

29
00:01:51.454 --> 00:01:52.494
Mandy whispered.

30
00:01:52.514 --> 00:01:56.475
"Our adventures can't stop now!"

31
00:01:57.296 --> 00:01:58.056
Vinnie said.

32
00:01:59.292 --> 00:02:02.373
They stared at the glowing helmet on the statue.

33
00:02:03.773 --> 00:02:07.895
They closed their eyes and fell down the deep dark tunnel.

34
00:02:07.915 --> 00:02:14.276
"Ow!" yelled Vinnie as he landed on a hard floor.

35
00:02:14.296 --> 00:02:20.538
"Hey!" he shouted as Mandy fell on top of him.

36
00:02:20.558 --> 00:02:23.719
"Sorry!" Mandy cried.

37
00:02:23.739 --> 00:02:26.580
"I can't help where I land."

38
00:02:28.656 --> 00:02:32.418
The children were in a room with baskets filled with thread.

39
00:02:33.019 --> 00:02:35.900
The rolls of thread were many different colors.

40
00:02:36.841 --> 00:02:40.683
A beautiful piece of cloth hung from a large wooden frame.

41
00:02:40.703 --> 00:02:44.085
"What's that?"

42
00:02:45.025 --> 00:02:46.306
asked Vinnie, pointing.

43
00:02:46.326 --> 00:02:50.649
"I think it's a loom," guessed Mandy.

44
00:02:50.669 --> 00:02:53.110
"You know, to weave cloth."

45
00:02:54.471 --> 00:02:56.332
"Look at what we're wearing!"

46
00:02:57.124 --> 00:02:59.605
Vinnie stood up to admire his clothes.

47
00:03:01.106 --> 00:03:03.087
He wore a short white tunic.

48
00:03:04.288 --> 00:03:06.649
Mandy had on a white tunic too.

49
00:03:07.650 --> 00:03:09.731
But hers reached to her ankles.

50
00:03:11.012 --> 00:03:15.194
Both tunics were fastened with small pins at the shoulders.

51
00:03:16.295 --> 00:03:17.955
The children heard voices.

52
00:03:17.975 --> 00:03:20.277
"Someone's coming!"

53
00:03:21.017 --> 00:03:22.038
whispered Mandy.

54
00:03:23.198 --> 00:03:26.140
The children looked around for a place to hide.

55
00:03:27.060 --> 00:03:29.622
Too late—the door opened.

56
00:03:30.963 --> 00:03:32.624
Vinnie and Mandy froze.

57
00:03:33.665 --> 00:03:35.426
Two young girls walked in.

58
00:03:36.927 --> 00:03:39.449
One girl, dressed in blue, stared at them.

59
00:03:39.469 --> 00:03:42.371
"What are you doing here?"

60
00:03:43.091 --> 00:03:45.033
she demanded, pointing at Vinnie.

61
00:03:45.053 --> 00:03:50.016
"Uh, well, I, uh stuttered Vinnie.

62
00:03:50.036 --> 00:03:53.639
"How dare you step inside the weaving room!"

63
00:03:54.259 --> 00:03:54.980
she shouted.

64
00:03:55.952 --> 00:03:57.875
"My father will not allow this!"
